@startuml
<style>
root {
  FontName Helvetica
  FontSize 12
  FontColor #000000
  BackGroundColor #FFFFFF
  LineColor #000000
  LineThickness 0.75
  RoundCorner 0
  Shadowing 0
}
title { FontSize 14; FontStyle bold; FontColor #000000; BackGroundColor transparent; LineColor transparent; LineThickness 0 }
stateDiagram {
  state { BackGroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #000000; FontColor #000000 }
  arrow { LineColor #000000; LineThickness 0.75 }
}
</style>
title Huimeng 1.0 - Generation Run State
[*] --> RESERVED : slot admitted
RESERVED --> RUNNING : Bun accepts
RESERVED --> FAILED : dispatch fails
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : final result
RUNNING --> FAILED : execution error
RUNNING --> CANCELLING : cancel requested
CANCELLING --> CANCELLED : Bun confirms stop
CANCELLING --> FAILED : cancellation fails and execution ends
RUNNING --> LOST : restart; cannot recover
CANCELLING --> LOST : restart; cannot recover
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
LOST --> [*] : only after execution is confirmed stopped
@enduml
